Symbiotic balance

The system should use constitutional asymmetry:

Models may propose.
Critics may challenge.
Tools may execute authorized operations.
Publishers may publish approved artifacts.
The corpus records provenance.
The human may veto, amend, or revoke.

No single node controls perception, memory, execution, and evaluation simultaneously.

\text{Separation of powers}
=
\text{Proposal}
\neq
\text{Approval}
\neq
\text{Execution}
\neq
\text{Audit}

That is how the Greater Pantheon gains agency without becoming one opaque autonomous actor.

